@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@orderServiceUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

### ========================================
### HEALTH CHECKS & SERVICE STATUS
### ========================================

### Health Check - Basic
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health Check - Detailed (with dependencies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/detailed

### Readiness Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### ========================================
### GET ORDERS FIRST (to use real order IDs)
### ========================================

# @name getOrders
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders

###

# Extract order IDs from the response
@premiumOrderId = {{getOrders.response.body.$.orders[0].id}}
@basicOrderId = {{getOrders.response.body.$.orders[1].id}}
@enterpriseOrderId = {{getOrders.response.body.$.orders[2].id}}

### ========================================
### INVOICE RETRIEVAL TESTS
### ========================================

### Test Case 1: List All Invoices (default pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices

###

### Test Case 2: List Invoices with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?page=1&limit=5

###

### Test Case 3: List Invoices - Filter by Status: Generated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=generated

###

### Test Case 4: List Invoices - Filter by Status: Pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=pending

###

### Test Case 5: Filter Invoices by Order ID - Premium Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?orderId={{premiumOrderId}}

###

### Test Case 6: Filter Invoices by Order ID - Basic Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?orderId={{basicOrderId}}

###

### Test Case 7: Filter Invoices by Order ID - Enterprise Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?orderId={{enterpriseOrderId}}

###

### Test Case 8: Combined Filters - Generated Status + Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=generated&page=1&limit=3

###

### Test Case 9: Combined Filters - Order ID + Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?orderId={{premiumOrderId}}&status=pending

###

### ========================================
### INVOICE LOOKUP TESTS
### ========================================

### Test Case 10: Get Invoice by Non-existent Invoice ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### ========================================
### INVOICE STATUS UPDATE TESTS
### ========================================

### Test Case 11: Update Invoice Status to 'generated'
# Note: This will only work if there are existing invoices
# Replace INVOICE_ID with an actual invoice ID from the list
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/INVOICE_ID/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "generated"
}

###

### Test Case 12: Update Invoice Status - Invalid Status (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/INVOICE_ID/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "invalid_status"
}

###

### ========================================
### VERIFICATION TESTS (After All Operations)
### ========================================

### Test Case 13: Verify Final Invoice List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices

###

### Test Case 14: Verify Generated Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=generated

###

### Test Case 15: Verify Pending Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=pending

###

### ========================================
### DOCUMENTATION & API TESTS
### ========================================

### Test Case 16: Get Swagger/OpenAPI Documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

###

### Test Case 17: Get OpenAPI JSON Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/json
